---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Layout title="Custom 3D design help">
 <section class="page-intro"><div class="container"><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Design help</span></p><p class="eyebrow kicker">Start with a what if</p><h1>You bring the idea.<br/>Let's give it shape.</h1><p class="lede">A sketch, a reference photo, or an idea that needs working out. Share the starting point and we'll talk through a path to a printable design.</p></div></section>
 <section class="container section service-grid"><div class="service-content"><h2>You don't need a finished model.</h2><p>Our design request is a place to explain what you want to make. We'll review the project with you, work out the scope, and confirm whether it's a fit.</p><p>A helpful starting point includes:</p><ul><li>What you'd like to create and how you'll use it</li><li>Sketches, photos, or examples of the shape</li><li>Approximate dimensions and any measurements that must fit</li><li>The number of finished pieces you need</li><li>Your desired timeline</li></ul><p>We'll agree on design work, revisions, deliverables, and printing costs before work starts.</p><a class="button" href="/project/?type=design">Tell us about your idea <Icon name="spark" size={18}/></a></div><aside class="service-aside"><p class="eyebrow kicker">From thought to thing</p><h2>A conversation first.</h2><div class="process-row"><span>01</span><div><h3>Tell us the goal.</h3><p>Describe the idea and attach anything that helps explain it.</p></div></div><div class="process-row"><span>02</span><div><h3>Agree on a plan.</h3><p>We review the scope, pricing, and what you can expect from the design work.</p></div></div><div class="process-row"><span>03</span><div><h3>Review, then print.</h3><p>You'll review the design before we move on to making your physical piece.</p></div></div></aside></section>
 <section class="wide-cta"><div class="container"><div><h2>Already have a model?</h2><p>Skip straight to a custom print request.</p></div><a class="button button-light" href="/project/?type=print">Upload your model <Icon name="upload" size={18}/></a></div></section>
</Layout>
